🛠 Installation & Setup
1️⃣ Install dependencies
npm install

2️⃣ Create .env file
VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:5000/api"

3️⃣ Run development server
npm run dev


Local URL:

http://localhost:5173

4️⃣ Build for production
npm run build
npm run preview

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔐 Authentication Flow (JWT)

User logs in using /auth/login

Access + Refresh tokens stored in httpOnly cookies

Axios interceptor refreshes token automatically

Redux Toolkit stores user info

Protected routes check user role

Example Axios instance:

export const axiosInstance = axios.create({
  baseURL: import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL,
  withCredentials: true,
});

👮 Role-Based UI Logic
Role	Permissions
ADMIN	Full access, create/edit/delete holidays
HR	Same as ADMIN
MANAGER	View only
EMPLOYEE	View only

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📅 Holiday Calendar Module (FullCalendar)

Features:

Click a date → Create holiday modal

Click an event → Edit/Delete modal

Tooltip includes:

Name

Country

Holiday type (optional / public)

Color coding:

Green → Public Holiday

Purple → Optional Holiday

Bulk holiday upload (.csv)

🧪 API Integration (Sample)

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🎨 Theme System

Uses CSS variables defined for both themes:

--background
--text
--card
--border

Automatically applied to:

Modals

Calendar

Forms

Layout

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔔 Notifications (react-hot-toast)

Used for:

Login success / failure

Holiday created / updated / deleted

CSV upload results

Validation errors

Example:

toast.success("Holiday created!");

❗ Troubleshooting
API CORS blocked

Backend must allow:

origin: "http://localhost:5173"
credentials: true

Calendar not showing

Ensure dates are ISO strings:

start: h.date

Upload button not visible

User must be ADMIN or HR.

